---
// Cootie-catcher flap BL — bottom-left triangle + center medallion.
// See COOTIE-SPEC.md. Split along the crease from apex (50,50) to base
// midpoint (25,66.15). Tone logic (top-left light): the left half shares
// its edge with the bright TL flap and faces up-left -> mid; the bottom
// half runs toward the darkest corner (50,82.3) next to the shadowed BR
// flap -> dark. Medallion: tiny accent diamond at the pin point.
// Do NOT change span classes, --cc-delay, or viewBox.
---
<span class="cc-flap cc-flap--bl" style="--cc-delay: 0.44s" aria-hidden="true">
  <svg class="cc-flap-svg" viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true">
    <polygon class="cc-paper cc-paper--dark" points="50,50 50,82.3 25,66.15" />
    <polygon class="cc-paper" points="50,50 25,66.15 0,50" />
    <!-- center medallion: small accent diamond at the pin point -->
    <polygon class="cc-paper cc-paper--accent" points="47,50 50,47 53,50 50,53" />
  </svg>
</span>
